        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hello, I am <strong>Rosh Rehman</strong>. I am an independent game/App developer with a deep passion for creating interactive experiences and telling stories through games.
        </p>

        <div class="quote">
            "I started developing this journey at a very challenging phase of my life, while I was gradually losing my eyesight. Being visually impaired made things difficult, but it could not stop my passion for creation. For me, developing is not just about coding, it's about proving that vision comes from determination, not just eyesight."
        </div>

        <p>
            I believe that limitations are only in the mind. My goal is to continue learning, building, and inspiring others who face similar challenges to never give up on their dreams.
        </p>

